      "statement": "The Display firmware's womo_weather_http module fetches current weather and a 5-day forecast from Open-Meteo (https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast) and pins ISRG Root X1 as the TLS trust anchor via cert_pem instead of the ESP-IDF certificate bundle.",
