      "id": "claim_64b9907d3fc14ed098ecfe2642f7a2bb",
      "statement": "womo_weather_http_start() creates a background task that fetches weather on a configurable interval (default 5 min, overridable via CONFIG_WOMO_OWM_UPDATE_MINUTES), retries after 30s on generic failure or 15 min on HTTP 429, and relies on GPS coordinates supplied via womo_weather_http_set_location() (pushed from router_poll_task) with NVS persistence of the last known position.",
