      "statement": "All outbound HTTPS requests in the Display firmware (Open-Meteo, Nominatim, Meteoalarm) are serialized through a single global semaphore (womo_http_mutex) because the ESP32-S3's internal SRAM cannot support concurrent TLS sessions, with esp_http_client_cleanup() required to run inside the mutex-held scope before release.",
